    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"Dementia is a commonly encountered disease in the community and by one estimate about half of the population above the age of 85 are affected with some form of dementia\", stated Dr. Shahid Baig, Consultant Neurologist at Aga Khan University Hospital (AKUH). He was giving a presentation on \"What is Dementia?\" at the monthly public health awareness programme, 'Signs, Symptoms and Care', on September 7, 2002.",
